You are working on my existing **Interactive Visual Tree Editor** project. Implement Day 16 completely, with a strong focus on correctness, maintainability, reliability, accessibility, and preserving all functionality completed in Days 1–15.

Treat this as an engineering task, not just a UI task. Inspect the existing repository, understand its architecture, implement the required changes, test them, and provide an honest final report.

**Primary objective:** When a user edits a workflow, their graph and supported settings should persist across page refreshes. The application must restore saved data safely, recover gracefully from corrupted or incompatible data, maintain correct undo/redo behavior, and never falsely claim that unsaved changes have been saved.

